<title>USA: ILX mulls acquisitions or mergers.</title>
<headline>ILX mulls acquisitions or mergers.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>ILX Inc said Tuesday it had retained EVEREN Securities Inc as its investment bank and financial advisor to evaluate possible acquisitions or mergers.</p>
<p>ILX said in a statement EVEREN will also evaluate options available to ILX to enhance shareholder value and promote long-term growth as well as evaluating capital raising strategies and providing access to the capital markets.</p>
<p>ILX develops, operates and markets upscale vacation ownership resorts and hotels.</p>
</text>
